  "text": "INNO3D GEFORCE RTX 5090 ICHILL FROSTBITE PRO HONORED WITH EUROPEAN PRODUCT DESIGN AWARD 2026 | Inno3D - Graphics Cards\nSkip to main content\nImage\nNEWS\nPRODUCTS\nGRAPHICS CARDS\niCHILL\nImage\nINNO3D\nImage\nENTERPRISE\nGPU\nRTX 50 Series\nImage\nRTX 40 Series\nImage\nRTX 30 Series\nImage\nGTX Series\nImage\nGT Series\nImage\nSUPPORT\nSOFTWARE\nINSTALLATION GUIDES\nSUPPORT FORM\n註冊延長保固\nWHERE TO BUY\nREDEMPTION\nABOUT\nABOUT INNO3D\nCONTACT US\nPRIVACY POLICY\nNEWS\nPRODUCTS\nGRAPHICS CARDS\niCHILL\nImage\nINNO3D\nImage\nENTERPRISE\nGPU\nRTX 50 Series\nImage\nRTX 40 Series\nImage\nRTX 30 Series\nImage\nGTX Series\nImage\nGT Series\nImage\nSUPPORT\nSOFTWARE\nINSTALLATION GUIDES\nSUPPORT FORM\n註冊延長保固\nWHERE TO BUY\nREDEMPTION\nABOUT\nABOUT INNO3D\nCONTACT US\nPRIVACY POLICY\nBreadcrumb\nHome\nINNO3D GEFORCE RTX 5090 ICHILL FROSTBITE PRO HONORED WITH EUROPEAN PRODUCT DESIGN AWARD 2026\nRTX 50 Series , Awards , 2026\n2026-09-25/News\nINNO3D is proud to announce that the GeForce RTX 5090 iCHILL Frostbite Pro has received the European Product Design Award 2026, recognising its outstanding combination of innovation, engineering, and design excellence.\nAward-Winning Design\nDesigned for enthusiasts and professionals, the iCHILL Frostbite Pro combines a high-performance full-cover water-cooling solution with an ultra-compact single-slot form factor. Its carbon fiber reinforced backplate provides enhanced durability while maintaining a lightweight design, delivering both exceptional thermal performance and visual sophistication.\nPushing GPU Design Forward\nThe European Product Design Award celebrates products that demonstrate innovation, functionality, and outstanding design. This recognition highlights INNO3D's commitment to developing graphics solutions that balance cutting-edge performance with refined aesthetics.\nInnovation Without Compromise\nThe award marks another milestone for INNO3D, reinforcing its dedication to advancing GPU technology through exceptional engineering and product design.\nRead more from EPDA\nINNO3D GeForce RTX™ 5090 iCHILL FROSTBITE PRO\nC50903-32D7X-1759FBP\nNEWSLETTER\nGet the latest news and more.\nLeave this field blank\nNEWS\nPRODUCTS\nGRAPHICS CARDS\niCHILL\nImage\nINNO3D\nImage\nENTERPRISE\nGPU\nRTX 50 Series\nImage\nRTX 40 Series\nImage\nRTX 30 Series\nImage\nGTX Series\nImage\nGT Series\nImage\nSUPPORT\nSOFTWARE\nINSTALLATION GUIDES\nSUPPORT FORM\n註冊延長保固\nWHERE TO BUY\nREDEMPTION\nABOUT\nABOUT INNO3D\nCONTACT US\nPRIVACY POLICY\n© Copyright © All Rights Reserved by INNO3D."
